BEGIN_PGML
Remi is studying college student demographics, including their ages. Let [_]{$a}{3} be the age of a student, measured in [_]{$years}{10}.

END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
The unknown quantity is age, which we generally measure in years. So we could say "Let [`a`] be the age of a student, measured in years."

END_PGML_SOLUTION

